[3] Young, J.A. and Koppel, J.U. Phys. Rev. A 135, 603 (1964)        3 1451
[4] Thermal Scattering Law S(a,b): Measurement, Evaluation and       3 1451
    Application,International Evaluation Cooperation Volume 42,      3 1451
    Nuclear Energy Agency, report number NEA No. 7511, 2020          3 1451
